tasks.details:
Implement robust dependency handling for ProtocolLib:

1. Enhance dependency verification:
   - Create a `DependencyManager` class to check for ProtocolLib at startup
   - Use `Bukkit.getPluginManager().getPlugin("ProtocolLib")` to verify plugin presence
   - Add version compatibility check for ProtocolLib

2. Implement graceful degradation:
   - Modify `FakePlayer` class to handle missing ProtocolLib
   - Create interface `EntityVisualizer` with two implementations:
     - `ProtocolLibVisualizer`: Uses ProtocolLib for advanced entity manipulation
     - `FallbackVisualizer`: Uses basic Bukkit API for simple villager NPCs
   - Implement factory pattern to select appropriate visualizer based on availability

3. Add clear user notifications:
   - Display console warnings when ProtocolLib is missing
   - Send admin notification on join if they have appropriate permissions
   - Add detailed installation instructions in console logs
   - Create config option to suppress warnings

4. Code example for dependency check:
```java
public class DependencyManager {
    private final JavaPlugin plugin;
    private boolean protocolLibAvailable = false;

    public DependencyManager(JavaPlugin plugin) {
        this.plugin = plugin;
        checkDependencies();
    }

    private void checkDependencies() {
        Plugin protocolLib = Bukkit.getPluginManager().getPlugin("ProtocolLib");
        if (protocolLib != null && protocolLib.isEnabled()) {
            protocolLibAvailable = true;
            plugin.getLogger().info("ProtocolLib found: " + protocolLib.getDescription().getVersion());
        } else {
            plugin.getLogger().warning("ProtocolLib not found or not enabled!");
            plugin.getLogger().warning("Advanced entity features will be disabled.");
            plugin.getLogger().warning("Install ProtocolLib: https://www.spigotmc.org/resources/protocollib.1997/");
        }
    }

    public boolean isProtocolLibAvailable() {
        return protocolLibAvailable;
    }
}
```

5. Implement safe error handling in command execution:
   - Modify `/ai-spawn` command to check dependency status before execution
   - Add fallback message explaining limited functionality
   - Create alternative command implementation that works without ProtocolLib

6. Update plugin.yml:
   - Change ProtocolLib from 'depend' to 'softdepend'
   - Add clear description of enhanced features with ProtocolLib
